 "reading": "Repaired, the six charts say that satisfaction moved from 4.15 to 4.07 and did not collapse, that arrivals grew by about 7% a year with a festival spike and did not jump 37%, that the highest complaint rates are at two small sites and not at the Cable Car, that hotels and sites move together only loosely, that local arrivals fell by 6% over two years and that total arrivals rose in both years. None of the charts shows uncertainty, so they do not tell a reader which of these differences could be chance."
